---
config:
  sequence:
    useMaxWidth: false
title: Simple Task - Interactions
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor R as Requester
    participant T as Simple Task
    actor F as Fulfiller
    actor M as Manager
    Note over R,M: Manager may perform every transition
    R->>T: Create task with details (New)
    R->>T: Request (Requested)
    alt Cancel while Requested
        R->>T: Cancel (Cancelled)
    else Start delivery
        F->>T: Start Work (Work in Progress)
        alt Cancel while Work in Progress
            R->>T: Cancel (Cancelled)
        else Deliver results
            F->>T: Work Completed with results and evidence (Complete)
            T-->>R: Request confirmation
            loop Each time the Requester requires continuation
                R->>T: Continue Work (Work in Progress)
                T-->>F: Continue delivery
                F->>T: Work Completed with updated evidence (Complete)
                T-->>R: Request confirmation again
            end
            R->>T: Close (Closed)
        end
    end
